@{" 1.3.1 Hardware Ports                " LINK ports}

+------------------+-----------------------------------------------------+
| Port Name        | Function                                            |
+------------------+-----------------------------------------------------+
| JTAG Port        | Connects to an Altera FPGA programmer to flash and  |
|                  | debug the FPGA. Should only be used for initial     |
|                  | programming or servicing the card.                  |
+------------------+-----------------------------------------------------+
| Analogue &       | 3.5 mm jack with combined stereo analogue / TOSLINK |
| TOSLINK Digital  | digital output, supporting up to 192 kHz,           |
| Output           | 24-bit audio data rates in both modes.              |
+------------------+-----------------------------------------------------+
| Analogue Input   | This port can directly connect to the AMIGA's       |
|                  | native PAULA audio signal, which is mixed and       |
|                  | output with the AmiGUS mini final output.           |
+------------------+-----------------------------------------------------+
| LED VU Meter     | Realtime display of the audio signal level,         |
|                  | showing up to 128 levels of intensity.              |
+------------------+-----------------------------------------------------+

