@{" 3.3   FPGA Flash Tool               " LINK flash1}

The AmiGUS Flash Tool provides full control over the AmiGUS mini FPGA
firmware settings.

This includes updating the firmware, displaying the card's hardware
status or initialising the configuration data used for the mixer settings.

@{"Flash tool" system "MultiView ilbm/flash10.iff"}@{IMG ilbm/flash10.iff}

@{" 3.3.1 Available Options             " LINK flash2}

@ENDNODE

@NODE flash2 "Software Tools - Available Options"
@TOC contents
@{" 3     Software Tools                " LINK sw_inst20}
